## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pathy
## Notes: Pick a quest giver or turn-in and be led there by a 3D arrow, with a guide window, along a planned route (walls, stairs, lifts, boats and zeppelins included). Uses Questie's WoW: Forever database for the places.
## Author: lil bub
## Version: 2.0.0
## Dependencies: Questie, BVAddonSuite_Routing
## OptionalDeps: WaypointTracker
## SavedVariables: PathyDB

